{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:05 2026-10-05 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日（5日）下午5時，警方接獲報案，指一名少年跳入於沙田碩門邨對開的城門河，途人見狀立即跳入河中將少年救起。兩人仍然清醒僅受輕傷，雙雙被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。據了解，少年今年15歲，案發時身穿校服，其母親陪同他送院，警方正調查其跳河原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"少年送院時仍然清醒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d27f7cb03f17fbbf7ac8d4603d981c90/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_17_55_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"少年送院時仍然清醒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b4da1dd75a1a8dd91fe9a1280864ef9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_17_55_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員到醫院了解少年跳河原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0e68a8bbd7727c825247535922e34a2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_17_58_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員到醫院了解少年跳河原因。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81f1d2bd30319820713ebb0b639025ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_17_58_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"少年的母親陪同送院。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bd439891971f89bf785bd6e2fcc5e98/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_17_57_13.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T10:19:33.418283+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}